  "question": {
    "text": "The volume of a cube is increasing at the rate of <math> <mrow> <mn>18</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup> <mrow> <mtext>cm</mtext></mrow> <mn>3</mn> </msup> </mrow> </math> per second. When the edge of the cube is <math><mn>12&nbsp;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m,</mi></math>&nbsp;then the rate in <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> at which the surface area of the cube increases, is"
  },
